    "summary": {
      "value": "Improve your magicannon and use it for an explosive attack."
    },
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Tinkerer</strong> and acquired the <strong>advanced Magitech</strong> benefit from the <strong>Gadget</strong> Skill.</p><hr><p>Your attacks with the @UUID[Compendium.projectfu.consumables.Item.AbazTRyaMTW4ouhx]{Magicannon (Item)} deal 5 extra damage.</p><p>When you perform the <strong>Attack</strong> action with your <strong>magicannon</strong>, , if you have no other weapon equipped, you may choose one option:</p><ul><li><p>Destroy the <strong>magicannon</strong>, then create and equip a new one <strong>for free</strong> (ignore the IP cost), using this newly equipped <strong>magicannon</strong> for your attack.</p></li><li><p>The attack gains <strong>multi (3)</strong>.</p></li><li><p>You perform two separate attacks instead of one, following the rules for <strong>two-weapon fighting</strong> (<strong>Core Rulebook</strong>, page <strong>69</strong>).</p></li></ul><hr><p><strong>Magicannon Gains:</strong> @EFFECT[pfu-weapon-damage-up]</p>",
